                    <div className="text-xs text-amber-800">
                      This FBG sensor is reporting strain values that exceed the simulated {selected.risk_level.toLowerCase()} threshold.
                      Risk classification is SIMULATED for this MVP and conceptually depends on baseline + trend + operating conditions + engineering thresholds.
                      This does NOT constitute a confirmed structural finding.
                    </div>
                  </div>
